SSH Manager outline icons

* The outline set (24x24 grid, 1.5px rounded stroke, currentColor) was drawn
  for SSH Manager in the style of popular outline icon sets. It is part of
  SSH Manager and is distributed under the same terms as the project.

* The session-tree family (sshm-folder, sshm-folder-open, sshm-file-conf,
  sshm-server and the sshm-badge-* overlays; 24x24 grid, badges 12x12) comes
  from the drafts supplied with the Phase 9 brief: a 1.75px outline converted
  to filled paths plus a 20% duotone fill, currentColor. The badge overlays
  were drawn for SSH Manager.

  NOTE: the folder and folder-open outlines appear to match the Lucide icon
  set (ISC license, https://lucide.dev). If they are kept, Lucide's ISC
  license notice must be included here; otherwise redraw them.
